sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as vLLM (/metrics)
    participant C as TelemetryCollector
    participant A as Aggregator
    participant P as Prometheus Exporter (/metrics)
    participant R as Redis Store

    loop Every 2 Seconds
        C->>V: HTTP GET /metrics
        V-->>C: Prometheus Metric Text
        C->>C: Parse GPU & Cache usage
        C->>A: Append Snapshot
        C->>P: Update Gauges
        C->>R: Update Active Request Index
    end
